    {
     "at": 0.45,
     "text": "Its eye lens was carbon dated: three hundred ninety-two years, give or take a hundred twenty.",
     "cap": "Eye lens dated: *392 years.* Give or take 120."
    }
   ],
   "vis": 0
  },
  {
   "dur": 4,
   "vo": [
    {
     "at": 0.45,
     "text": "It grows about one centimeter a year, and becomes an adult at around a hundred fifty.",
     "cap": "*1 cm* a year. Adult at *150.*"
    }
   ],
   "vis": 1
  },
  {
   "dur": 4,
   "vo": [
    {
     "at": 0.45,
     "text": "And it gets huge. Up to six point four meters, and more than a tonne.",
     "cap": "Up to *6.4 m.* Over *1,000 kg.*"
    }
   ],
   "vis": 2
  },
  {
   "dur": 4,
   "vo": [
    {
     "at": 0.45,
     "text": "Many are almost blind. A parasite hangs from their eyes.",
     "cap": "Almost *blind.* A parasite hangs from its *eyes.*"
    }
   ],
   "vis": 3
  },
  {
   "dur": 4,
   "vo": [
    {
     "at": 0.45,
     "text": "Yet in their stomachs: reindeer, moose, even polar bear.",
     "cap": "In its stomach: *reindeer,* *moose,* *polar bear.*"
    }
   ],
   "vis": 4
  },
  {
   "dur": 4,
   "vo": [
    {
     "at": 0.45,
     "text": "Its meat is toxic. In Iceland, they ferment it and dry it.",
     "cap": "Its meat is *toxic.* Iceland *ferments* it."
    },
    {
